@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

actor Utilisateur

participant "Navigateur" as Browser
participant "Routeur Django\n(urls.py)" as URL
participant "Vue Django\n(views.py)" as View
participant "ORM Django" as ORM
database "SQLite" as DB

Utilisateur -> Browser : Consulte la page d'accueil
Browser -> URL : GET /entraide/
URL -> View : Appelle index(request)

activate View

View -> ORM : Recherche les prochains créneaux
ORM -> DB : SELECT sur Schedule
DB --> ORM : Résultats
ORM --> View : QuerySet de créneaux

View -> Browser : render(index.html)
deactivate View

Browser --> Utilisateur : Affiche la page HTML

@enduml
